{"id":"fdee91a683a5c7c3","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-omega-tower.md","title":"有限 ω 幂塔","display":"df-omega-tower — 有限 ω 幂塔","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-omega-tower","aliases":["18-df-omega-tower"],"display":"df-omega-tower — 有限 ω 幂塔","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§3.3.1; §7.3 (local finite-iteration notation)","source_pages":"33, 115–116","source_pdf_pages":"43, 125–126","verification_status":"local-definition-source-compatible"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-omega-tower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-omega-tower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-tower — 有限 ω 幂塔"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.1; §7.3 (local finite-iteration notation)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"33, 115–116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"43, 125–126"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-source-compatible"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;\\omega\">\\(n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\beta\">\\(\\omega^\\beta\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a> 的序数幂。对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>，以下自然数递归定义唯一集合函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto\\omega_n(\\alpha)\">\\(n\\mapsto\\omega_n(\\alpha)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega_0(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\qquad\n\\omega_{n+1}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\omega^{\\omega_n(\\alpha)}\\quad(n&lt;\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega_0(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\qquad\n\\omega_{n+1}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\omega^{\\omega_n(\\alpha)}\\quad(n&lt;\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书后续用迭代 ω 幂估计有限层切消；本节点将有限递归显式固定为起始参数 α。不同起始参数的记号不得混用；ε₀ 可取从 1 或 ω 起始塔的上确界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$；$\\omega^\\beta$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]] 的序数幂。对每个固定 $\\alpha$，以下自然数递归定义唯一集合函数 $n\\mapsto\\omega_n(\\alpha)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"n<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto\\omega_n(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_0(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\qquad\n\\omega_{n+1}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\omega^{\\omega_n(\\alpha)}\\quad(n<\\omega).","display":true}],"bytes":1149,"backlinks":[{"id":"9fc246f88d0f85c8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Epsilon}$ 见 [[18-df-epsilon-ordinal]]，$\\omega_n(1)$ 见 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。定义下列序数常元 $\\varepsilon_0$。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-omega-tower]]"},{"id":"62c13ef1c5cb9a73","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 按 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，$\\omega_n(\\alpha)$ 按 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。"},{"id":"9219de2ac0937f15","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varepsilon_0$ 见 [[18-df-least-epsilon-ordinal]]，$\\varphi_1$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]，$\\omega_n$ 见 [[18-df-omega-tower]]。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-omega-tower]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","5c52eb8a9d5ba532"]}